Website for Nurdle detection

How to run:

1. (Optional) Create a virtual environment
2. Install the dependencies from requirements.txt by running "pip install -r requirements.txt" in a terminal
3. Then run the website by using this command also in the terminal "python app.py"
4. Access the website from the web by using the URL provided by the command above OR from localhost:5000.

How to run for phone usage:

1. open a terminal with .venv environemnt
2. run the app with python app.python
3. install ngrok from https://dashboard.ngrok.com/get-started/setup/windows
3. open another terminal and run ngrok.exe
4. in the ngrok terminal run ngrok http 5000
5. it should give you a website that will look like this: Forwarding   https://abcd1234.ngrok.io
